  "evidenceBoundary": {
    "direct": "On the selected unpatched and successful load branch, entries with Version greater than resolved m_activePhase feed Entry.Id to m_banned.Add; m_needCheck records whether a candidate was processed. The unpatched scene query passes globalId to IsBanned, which returns false when m_needCheck is false and otherwise returns m_banned.Contains(globalId).",
    "conditional": "IFix patch checks in LoadFromBasePath, IsEntityVersionBanned, and IsBanned can route away from these bodies. File and version-root validity, major/minor match, and active-phase guards also select the loading branch. Reset clears the set on its unpatched branch.",
    "unresolved": "No live patch state, active phase, selected version file, or observed ban result is established. The selected LoadFromBasePath body does not directly call HashSet.Clear; whether one ban-set object is reused across loads remains open."
  }
